        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yoshuwa goojeakta fuga gwalsa ghaang' mujiineeda Yeriko",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean goojeakta Yoshuwa was orjeeda Nuni fih iyeenya aba makcheameeda nea ghang'eada ng'eanyiida Shitimu ghaghwalda ghaang' ak gwayeesha, “Aweayeena, asikteawana ng'eanyiida Yeriko.” Hean geeweay, ea eahita gheeh Rahabooda hiseada, ak gwalla hoowa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak geerukusa sugoocheanda Yeriko nea geeyeesha, “Ng'ula nupka fiispa Israeli hiji ghoosa eawa gwasikteawa ng'eanyiida.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean goojeaksa sugoocheanda Yeriko buuneeda heeda Rahabu nea gwayeesha, “Aruuni jarooda fuga buwa headaang'u, fuga hidu jeedeaba gheang'u; aba gideaba ghapka gwasikteawa haleanjeeda sean bea ng'eanyiida.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gageanu gatmoodida fugiga asiyeenyean ak ghafuy; ak gwayeesha, “Huumwa gil buuneeda nupka gheenyu, ak ea mwaanali heeleabu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak damandida sijapa dooshta nea gamisaniidiin, ghwarita fiisu jarooda; ak ea mwaanali heeda gal, ayaada geeshta nea ghoalamwaji gajarani.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea ghana niny ea niidiing'da saawa uhuuda gheeda, ak ghafuy aba mbarariida miyaasiin abwarghaan aba uhuuda bulaliida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gaweay fugiga siicheaguun ak ghwaat geeshteaba fugiga nea ghwaat naweeda gal Yordani ea eahita ghuuteenda, iidu nea gwarita fugiga siicheaguun hean geajap dooshta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Damanda mii ghabeawa fugiga ruweanga, hean gawa heeda gwachi fuysa buuneeda was uhuuda gheeda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gwayeesha fugiga, “Ghaanali gideaba NG'UTAMIIDA nigooneegwa ng'eanyiini, ak ea niibiseasa muuwda aba madeedeang'wa, nea fuga sean bea ng'eanyiida ea ninyar aba madeedeang'wa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba geayiinyi gidanung' NG'UTAMIIDA ghaghajaamiita beega basooda Shaamu aba madeedeang'wa damanda ooscheeng'ni ng'eanyiida Misri, ea gidahinda sugoodigiga asiyeenya bea Amoriin aba giigheawda Yordani, nea Sihoni gil ea Ogu, damanda oonung' goosheala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea geayiinyi ng'asheesu ghwanyar jeesingaasa, ak ea mudugwanda siida mwaayi aba badaydeang'wa, aba gideaba NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA niny ASEETA humng'eeda gil ea ng'eanyiida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ghamneawa ayeaksean habeawooda aba NG'UTAMIIDA aba gideaba neasineegwa ng'asheesu miyaasiin ak eara agooga goosisi gheeda ghweandeanyu gea miyaasiin nea googoonyean giirooraneeda doobiiwnata, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea gideaba gajeakghuuha eaweega bwaabwa ea gea iyya, ea orjoogiyya ea haweega iyya ea haleanjeeda sean mideawa saawa, ea gideaba gajeakghuuha eaweagaasa aba miyeeda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda fugigeanji ak gwayeesha gatmooda, “Eaweagaasa aba eaweegeagwa inyas goorukuti gadiyeeni iteanyean damanda jea gagooneasa NG'UTAMIIDA ng'eanyiini abeeda gajeesineey gea miyaasiin aba doobiiwnata.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghoararaang'daawa mareamarooda nea goosiik seawadeeda, aba gideaba gheanyi abeeda gwanda guumda ghamarda mujiini ak goobiita jeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayeesha saawa, “Aweayeena jeeda heayeeniga, afunya geat adaghwanyaseagwa fugiga gaseadayeegwean afunya geat eawooji samwagu, ea gabiikta fugiga gaseadayeegwean, ak abeeda gooweayi heechea aweayeena.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha fugigeani gatmooda, “Aseasa meegasi gideaba gajeanyasa giidiinyeanda aba habeawooni inung' eayaagaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ula, inyas geapkaanyi jeedeaba ng'eanyiini, abeeda rasiina weasi arearaan seawadeeda iraraang'daawaneasa ak abeeda gibwadi geat aba gheang'u gweanu ea geamadu, ea orjooga geamadu, ea fuga sean mida ghaheang'wa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea gili was sih jea gwarina gidaghuuteaba gheang'u ak gawa naweeda abeeda foojeandaanyi gaygwanda uhuudaanyi nea gabwageaw, ak aseasa ea majeendeawana ramaseanda; nea geatinda iisiyiin uhuumba siida wassean indeayeesi jeeda gheeda, foojeandaanyi gaygwanda iheengaasa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea inyas girukuti gadiyeeni iteanyean, abeeda ea majeendeawana giidiinyeanda aba habeawooda inung' eayaaga.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda ak gwayeesha, “Aba ng'asheegeagwa gagasa gwasa gidoanyaashti.” Hean gooruuta ak gaweay, ng'ata gaweay; hean gwarasa weastida arearaan seawadeeda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gaweay fugiga jeesinga heayeeniga, ak goobiida hoowa eawooji samwagu ea gabiikta fugiga gaseadayi saawaan nea nigaseada aba naweadinga sean ak ea mwanyasa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwararang'aana fugiga gicha aba iheenga heayeeniga fugiga asiyeenyean ak ghoaghaaw ak ghwahita heeda Yoshuwa was orjeeda Nuni; ak geerukusa niny ng'asheega sean bussa saawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 2:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayeesha Yoshuwa, “Aba huumwa NG'UTAMIIDA niyiin ng'eanyiisean geatingaasa; nea eara fuga sean bea ng'eanyiida ea nibeal aba madeedeanya.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
